## About

{{SITE_NAME}} was born from a simple, verifiable observation: founders and managing partners are brilliant at what they do, but the operational weight of running a company — admin, finance, HR, data, growth — buries them. Not for lack of talent. For lack of time and structure.

Since April 2005, {{SITE_NAME}} has been the partner that handles what falls through the cracks. We started with a radical commitment: instead of advising from the outside, embed directly into the operations. Run the back-office. Own the transformation. Build the growth engine. Not as consultants who leave reports — as operators who deliver results.

Twenty years later, that model hasn't changed. What has changed is the depth: from pure operations, {{SITE_NAME}} has added transformation & data expertise and growth engineering (see Team below). Three pillars, one promise: {{SLOGAN_LOWER}}, we do the work that frees your time.

